\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase Unique Meta Progressions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fish bones during each bounty hunt to unlock permanent abilities and mutations, perks, ship mounts, and even hire new bounty hunters. An achievement-based system is used to reward you after every accomplishment -- because after all, <strong>'<i>curiosity killed the </i></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"><i>cat</i></span><i> <strong>bounties'</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/e1079771243162ab9c0081d2a77686cb.poster.avif?t=1758116245\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/e1079771243162ab9c0081d2a77686cb.webm?t=1758116245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/e1079771243162ab9c0081d2a77686cb.mp4?t=1758116245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Off Against the Galaxy's Toughest Bounties</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on Elites, Outlaws, and Colossal enemies solo or with up to 4 bounty hunters. As you grow stronger, so will your bounties. Learn from your mistakes and keep striving to unlock the full potential of each bounty hunter -- you'll need it to face what's coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scalable auto-firing weapons and abilities; wield up to 6 unique weapons and 6 cat-themed abilities chosen from 40 available weapons/fusions and 10 available abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating tough bounties will reward you with <strong><u>Purr Packs</u></strong>; the only way to unlock powerful<strong> weapon fusions</strong>\u00a0(when compatible weapons and abilities are paired)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual <u><strong>10-minute</strong></u> bounty hunts; 20-minute Normal bounty hunts and Endless bounty hunts are also available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through deep space with 8 distinctive bounty hunters; with each playable character having a <strong>rechargeable special ability</strong>\u00a0and<strong> unique starting weapon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take bounty hunts to the next level with Local Co-Op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting tuna cans levels your abilities and weapons in-game, while collecting fish bones and bounties allows for purchasing meta-progressions outside of bounty hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the gameplay to your liking with enemy modifiers (health, damage, and speed), 5 difficulty modes (3 unlock-able), and other accessibility features</p></li></ul>","developers":["nubes_ix"],"dlc":[3688700],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/9f4317a6126bb2fee186b48a5a897b884f0f5f9a/header.jpg?t=1758116245","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Distributions Released Post-2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-Core, 32-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics with Vulkan 1.0 Support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Distributions Released Post-2020<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-Core, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stro